          "type": "user",
          "text": "# Agent User Interaction Protocol SDK Event Types\n\n## Complete Event Catalog\n\nThe SDK defines 19 event types organized into five categories:\n\n### Lifecycle Events\n\n**RunStartedEvent**\n```typescript\ntype RunStartedEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.RUN_STARTED\n  threadId: string\n  runId: string\n  parentRunId?: string\n  input?: RunAgentInput\n}\n```\nInitiates an agent execution session with thread and run identifiers.\n\n**RunFinishedEvent**\n```typescript\ntype RunFinishedEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.RUN_FINISHED\n  threadId: string\n  runId: string\n  result?: any\n}\n```\nMarks successful completion and delivers outcome data.\n\n**RunErrorEvent**\n```typescript\ntype RunErrorEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.RUN_ERROR\n  message: string\n  code?: string\n}\n```\nCommunicates execution failures with descriptive messaging.\n\n**StepStartedEvent / StepFinishedEvent**\n```typescript\ntype StepStartedEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.STEP_STARTED\n  stepName: string\n}\n```\nDelineates discrete processing phases within runs.\n\n---\n\n### Text Message Events\n\n**TextMessageStartEvent**\n```typescript\ntype TextMessageStartEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TEXT_MESSAGE_START\n  messageId: string\n  role: \"assistant\"\n}\n```\nOpens a message stream with unique identifier.\n\n**TextMessageContentEvent**\n```typescript\ntype TextMessageContentEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT\n  messageId: string\n  delta: string\n}\n```\nDelivers incremental text chunks for streaming responses.\n\n**TextMessageEndEvent**\n```typescript\ntype TextMessageEndEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TEXT_MESSAGE_END\n  messageId: string\n}\n```\nTerminates message transmission.\n\n**TextMessageChunkEvent** (Convenience type)\n```typescript\ntype TextMessageChunkEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TEXT_MESSAGE_CHUNK\n  messageId?: string\n  role?: 'developer' | 'system' | 'assistant' | 'user'\n  delta?: string\n}\n```\n\"The client transforms chunk sequences into the standard start/content/end triad.\"\n\n---\n\n### Tool Call Events\n\n**ToolCallStartEvent**\n```typescript\ntype ToolCallStartEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TOOL_CALL_START\n  toolCallId: string\n  toolCallName: string\n  parentMessageId?: string\n}\n```\nAnnounces function invocation with metadata.\n\n**ToolCallArgsEvent**\n```typescript\ntype ToolCallArgsEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TOOL_CALL_ARGS\n  toolCallId: string\n  delta: string\n}\n```\nProvides streaming argument fragments.\n\n**ToolCallEndEvent**\n```typescript\ntype ToolCallEndEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TOOL_CALL_END\n  toolCallId: string\n}\n```\nCompletes argument transmission.\n\n**ToolCallResultEvent**\n```typescript\ntype ToolCallResultEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TOOL_CALL_RESULT\n  messageId: string\n  toolCallId: string\n  content: string\n  role?: \"tool\"\n}\n```\nReturns execution output with bidirectional message linkage.\n\n**ToolCallChunkEvent** (Convenience type)\n```typescript\ntype ToolCallChunkEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.TOOL_CALL_CHUNK\n  toolCallId?: string\n  toolCallName?: string\n  parentMessageId?: string\n  delta?: string\n}\n```\nStreamlines tool invocation into unified chunk delivery.\n\n---\n\n### State Management Events\n\n**StateSnapshotEvent**\n```typescript\ntype StateSnapshotEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.STATE_SNAPSHOT\n  snapshot: any\n}\n```\nCaptures complete agent state at a moment.\n\n**StateDeltaEvent**\n```typescript\ntype StateDeltaEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.STATE_DELTA\n  delta: any[]\n}\n```\nApplies RFC 6902 JSON Patch operations for incremental updates.\n\n**MessagesSnapshotEvent**\n```typescript\ntype MessagesSnapshotEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT\n  messages: Message[]\n}\n```\nProvides conversation history in single payload.\n\n**ActivitySnapshotEvent**\n```typescript\ntype ActivitySnapshotEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT\n  messageId: string\n  activityType: string\n  content: Record<string, any>\n  replace?: boolean\n}\n```\nDelivers structured activity metadata (e.g., PLAN, SEARCH).\n\n**ActivityDeltaEvent**\n```typescript\ntype ActivityDeltaEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.ACTIVITY_DELTA\n  messageId: string\n  activityType: string\n  patch: any[]\n}\n```\nUpdates activity payloads using JSON Patch semantics.\n\n---\n\n### Special Events\n\n**RawEvent**\n```typescript\ntype RawEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.RAW\n  event: any\n  source?: string\n}\n```\nPasses through third-party system events without transformation.\n\n**CustomEvent**\n```typescript\ntype CustomEvent = BaseEvent & {\n  type: EventType.CUSTOM\n  name: string\n  value: any\n}\n```\nEnables domain-specific event extension beyond core types.\n\n---\n\n## BaseEvent Foundation\n\nAll events inherit shared properties:\n\n```typescript\ntype BaseEvent = {\n  type: EventType\n  timestamp?: number\n  rawEvent?: any\n}\n```\n\nThe architecture uses \"a streaming event-based architecture\" where events function as fundamental communication units between agents and frontends.",
